        <ul>
            <li><b>Keyword Optimization:</b> Enhanced plugin metadata for better discoverability in <b>Android Studio</b> and <b>IntelliJ IDEA</b>.</li>
            <li><b>Quick Review:</b> Added "Rate LeakLens" action to the Tools menu for easier user feedback.</li>
            <li><b>Stability:</b> Improved <b>Heap Analysis</b> reliability on latest <b>Android Studio Ladybug</b> versions.</li>
        </ul>
        <h4>0.1.2</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><b>Internal API Fixes:</b> Resolved 15 verification errors to ensure compatibility with <b>JetBrains Marketplace</b> standards.</li>
            <li><b>Memory Management:</b> Optimized <b>Kotlin Coroutine</b> scopes and explicit Disposable cleanup for better plugin performance.</li>
            <li><b>Gradle Stability:</b> Enhanced support for experimental <b>Gradle</b> and <b>Kotlin JVM</b> versions.</li>
        </ul>
