            <li><b>UAST Migration:</b> Full support for <b>Kotlin</b> and <b>Java</b> static analysis inspections.</li>
            <li><b>UX Polish:</b> New <b>IntelliJ UI DSL 2</b> implementation for a native Look & Feel.</li>
            <li><b>ADB Reliability:</b> Optimized device communication for faster <b>Heap Dump</b> captures.</li>
